ok random seed(n) answers the seed back, any whole number, past one limb and below zero
ok random fast(1, 6) draws a die, both ends included
ok random fast(0, 100, 5) lands on min, min + step and so on up to max
ok random normal(10 ^ 40, 10 ^ 40) is exact at any size
ok random ultra(2) is a count of digits, 0 up to 99
